  "description": "The iOS / Messenger back gesture for Blazor: drag from the screen edge, the page follows the finger, let go past the threshold and it leaves. Works in MAUI Blazor Hybrid, WebAssembly and Server. Ships its own JS as a static web asset - no npm, no CDN, no script tag.",
